Prior to .NET 4.5.2

// DTD expansion is enabled by default
XmlReaderSettings settings = new XmlReaderSettings();
XmlReader reader = XmlReader.Create(inputXml, settings);
XmlDocument xmlDoc = new XmlDocument();
xmlDoc.Load(pathToXmlFile);
Console.WriteLine(xmlDoc.InnerText);
.NET 4.5.2 and later

In .NET Framework versions 4.5.2 and up, XmlTextReader's internal XmlResolver is set to null by default, making the XmlTextReader ignore DTDs by default. The XmlTextReader can become unsafe if if you create your own non-null XmlResolver with default or unsafe settings.Vulnerable Code
